# The web intake process's configuration (docs 04, 05). Copy to .env.intake, which is gitignored; never commit real
# values. This file holds ONLY the two keys below: intake/intake_core.py refuses any other key, and in particular
# DATABRICKS_TOKEN (the dbt personal access token, which lives in .env and never belongs here).
#
# Values already in the process environment win over this file. GEMINI_API_KEY is a key from Google AI Studio; it is
# sent only in the x-goog-api-key header of the inference request and is never logged.
GEMINI_API_KEY=
INFERENCE_MODEL=gemini-3.1-flash-lite
